  "notes": "Image titled ESP32 TTGO T-Beam V1.1. Diagram labels and board silkscreen both list 13 pins per header and agree in order. Silkscreen spellings (VP, VN, TX, RX, 3V3, 3.3V, LoRa1, LoRa2) placed first in functions where different. LoRa module, GPS, buttons and AXP192 chip drawing are internal/not wiring points and skipped. Lora_IO1/IO2 read with letter O per IO rule."
